                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="3f41a627-5f7d-50f0-7df8-88b4cf30b701">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_CluScaleActive</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
Decides if scaling of capabilities with clutch pedal position is active.

###Usage
Set to true to activate clutch scaling.

###Calibration Note
Set to false if transmission is automatic - this functionality is for manual transmissions.
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
                                                    </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                            </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                            <TYPE-TREF DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/ApplDataTypes/T_BOOLEAN</TYPE-TREF>
                                            <INIT-VALUE>
                                                <CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                                    <SHORT-LABEL>STCWke_b_CluScaleActive</SHORT-LABEL>
                                                    <CONSTANT-REF DEST="CONSTANT-SPECIFICATION">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/Ground/STCWke_b_CluScaleActive</CONSTANT-REF>
                                                </CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                            </INIT-VALUE>
                                        </PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="172ad5ea-49bd-59b2-dbc5-079d1187bff7">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_CluScaleUseCmd</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
Used to slect which signal from clucth capbilities to use for scaling P3/P4 motor capabilitiies

###Usage
If true, clutch command signal is used, instead of raw clutch position value, for scaling
EM capabilities.

###Calibration Note
This functionality is for manual transmissions


</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
                                                    </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                            </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                            <TYPE-TREF DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/ApplDataTypes/T_BOOLEAN</TYPE-TREF>
                                            <INIT-VALUE>
                                                <CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                                    <SHORT-LABEL>STCWke_b_CluScaleUseCmd</SHORT-LABEL>
                                                    <CONSTANT-REF DEST="CONSTANT-SPECIFICATION">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/Ground/STCWke_b_CluScaleUseCmd</CONSTANT-REF>
                                                </CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                            </INIT-VALUE>
                                        </PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="9052a655-4b0a-5c59-4642-566587a0d436">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_DisableP1ToWheelNoGear</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
Enables the if nor gear is reported to be avaiable it will also disable the P1 capabilites possibility to transfer torque to the wheels

###Usage
Set to to true to enable that Gearavailable disables that P1 capability is added to wheel caps
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
