                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_EnblP1NegTrqAtWheelSwitchOff</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
This calibration enables functionality to disable that P1 system can be used to put negative torque on wheel when transmisson not have control of the P1 speed and torque.
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
