                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_LimitBoostInTotCapability</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">Limits the total capability with the boost torque limitation from BORE</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
                                                    </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                            </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                            <TYPE-TREF DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/ApplDataTypes/T_BOOLEAN</TYPE-TREF>
                                            <INIT-VALUE>
                                                <CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                                    <SHORT-LABEL>STCWke_b_LimitBoostInTotCapability</SHORT-LABEL>
                                                    <CONSTANT-REF DEST="CONSTANT-SPECIFICATION">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/Ground/STCWke_b_LimitBoostInTotCapability</CONSTANT-REF>
                                                </CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                            </INIT-VALUE>
                                        </PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="20731629-0894-5027-7fa5-2cb55a31956f">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_LimitP1CapWithP1Cap</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
This enables the functionality to limit the minimum allowed P1 torque with the minimum limit from the idle controller with the same limit that is used for limiting P1 to wheel

###Usage
Set to TRUE to enable correction of P1 min torque with idlecontroller min torque. If FALSE no correction is made
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
                                                    </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                            </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                            <TYPE-TREF DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/ApplDataTypes/T_BOOLEAN</TYPE-TREF>
                                            <INIT-VALUE>
                                                <CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                                    <SHORT-LABEL>STCWke_b_LimitP1CapWithP1Cap</SHORT-LABEL>
                                                    <CONSTANT-REF DEST="CONSTANT-SPECIFICATION">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/Ground/STCWke_b_LimitP1CapWithP1Cap</CONSTANT-REF>
                                                </CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                            </INIT-VALUE>
                                        </PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="939e3e46-2b00-5fa0-68ca-4035d0902d7d">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_LimitP1CapabilityWithIdleLimit</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
This enables the functionality to limit the minimum allowed P1 torque with the minimum limit from the idle controller

###Usage
Set to TRUE to enable correction of P1 min torque with idlecontroller min torque. If FALSE no correction is made

###Calibration Note
This calibration has no function if STCWke_b_LimitWheelCapabilityWithIdleLim is TRUE. If limiting of wheel torque is enables this will also enable the P1 torque capability
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
                                                    </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                            </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                            <TYPE-TREF DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/ApplDataTypes/T_BOOLEAN</TYPE-TREF>
                                            <INIT-VALUE>
                                                <CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                                    <SHORT-LABEL>STCWke_b_LimitP1CapabilityWithIdleLimit</SHORT-LABEL>
                                                    <CONSTANT-REF DEST="CONSTANT-SPECIFICATION">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/Ground/STCWke_b_LimitP1CapabilityWithIdleLimit</CONSTANT-REF>
                                                </CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                            </INIT-VALUE>
                                        </PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="6c8c3576-dc89-5b3e-5921-941bffe53ccd">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_LimitWheelCapabilityWithIdleLim</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
This enables the functionality to limit the minimum allowed P1 torque with the minimum limit from the idle controller

###Usage
Set to TRUE to enable correction of P1 min torque with idlecontroller min torque. If FALSE no correction is made

###Calibration Note
This calibration has no function if STCWke_b_LimitWheelCapabilityWithIdleLim is TRUE. If limiting of wheel torque is enables this will also enable the P1 torque capability

</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
