                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="0bb5042a-54c6-5fcf-9743-559f52ebc3c8">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_NoP1ToWhlTrqInRvrsEnbl</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
Used to set the wheel torque capability from the P1 system when the driver intended torque direction is reverse.

###Usage
If true STCW sets the wheel torque capability from the P1 actuators to zero in reverse

###Calibration Note
Intended use is setting this to TRUE if the gearbox transferring torque from the P1 system to the wheels does not support reverse gear

</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
                                                    </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                            </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                            <TYPE-TREF DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/ApplDataTypes/T_BOOLEAN</TYPE-TREF>
                                            <INIT-VALUE>
                                                <CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                                    <SHORT-LABEL>STCWke_b_NoP1ToWhlTrqInRvrsEnbl</SHORT-LABEL>
                                                    <CONSTANT-REF DEST="CONSTANT-SPECIFICATION">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/Ground/STCWke_b_NoP1ToWhlTrqInRvrsEnbl</CONSTANT-REF>
                                                </CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                            </INIT-VALUE>
                                        </PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="daf70544-00b5-5ece-0a49-4b0902b4dca7">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_NotLimitDrvrTqDmTotMinToEngMin</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">If false the driver requested torque can only be down to EngMin + P3 Min

This to avoid to not promize to a capabilty that we can not promize
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
                                                    </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                            </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                            <TYPE-TREF DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/ApplDataTypes/T_BOOLEAN</TYPE-TREF>
                                            <INIT-VALUE>
                                                <CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                                    <SHORT-LABEL>STCWke_b_NotLimitDrvrTqDmTotMinToEngMin</SHORT-LABEL>
                                                    <CONSTANT-REF DEST="CONSTANT-SPECIFICATION">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/Ground/STCWke_b_NotLimitDrvrTqDmTotMinToEngMin</CONSTANT-REF>
                                                </CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                            </INIT-VALUE>
                                        </PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="de7d8202-13b9-547d-09dc-5822b22fe96c">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_OnlyAllowBrakeRegenInForward</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">If true brake regen will only be allowed when driver intenededn torque direction is forward.

If this calibration is false. Brake regen will be allowed when torque is allowed to be put on wheels by the driver. (Forward and Reverse)
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
