                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="82b65906-110b-551c-daee-9f039a695a8e">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_ParkLockInhibitTimeEnable</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">Enable use of maximum time for ParkLock to inhibit propulsion.
If true, ParkLock can not inhibit Propulsion Allowed for more than STCWke_t_ParkLockInhibitDuration seconds.
If false, ParkLock will always inhibit Propulsion Allowed if it is not \Open\.
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
