                                        <PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE UUID="9f0472b9-a664-542e-04a3-aab2dd492f04">
                                            <SHORT-NAME>STCWke_b_RdcBrkRgnWithActCstTq</SHORT-NAME>
                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">###Description
Enables/disables it actual coast regen demand is subtracted from Brake Regen Capability

###Usage
If false, Actual Coast Regen has no effect on Brake Regen Capability
If true, the Brake Regen Capability is reduced with how much torque is actually demanded by Coast Regen.

###Calibration Note
</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
                                            <CATEGORY>BOOLEAN</CATEGORY>
                                            <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                                <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                                    <SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                        <SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>READ-WRITE</SW-CALIBRATION-ACCESS>
                                                        <SW-IMPL-POLICY>STANDARD</SW-IMPL-POLICY>
                                                    </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-CONDITIONAL>
                                                </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS-VARIANTS>
                                            </SW-DATA-DEF-PROPS>
                                            <TYPE-TREF DEST="APPLICATION-PRIMITIVE-DATA-TYPE">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/ApplDataTypes/T_BOOLEAN</TYPE-TREF>
                                            <INIT-VALUE>
                                                <CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                                    <SHORT-LABEL>STCWke_b_RdcBrkRgnWithActCstTq</SHORT-LABEL>
                                                    <CONSTANT-REF DEST="CONSTANT-SPECIFICATION">/STCW_pkg/STCW_dt/Ground/STCWke_b_RdcBrkRgnWithActCstTq</CONSTANT-REF>
                                                </CONSTANT-REFERENCE>
                                            </INIT-VALUE>
                                        </PARAMETER-DATA-PROTOTYPE>
