                                            <DESC>
                                                <L-2 L="FOR-ALL">If true and STCWke_b_UseTotCapForBrkRegenCapCalc is false the brake regen capability is calculated based on the total torque from the electrical motors. P1+P3</L-2>
                                            </DESC>
